    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nIdeally located in the heart of Kilkenny City Centre, this well-presented two-bedroom apartment offers the perfect combination of convenience, comfort and city living. Situated within walking distance of a wide range of amenities, the property is ideally suited to first-time buyers, investors or those seeking a low-maintenance home in a prime central location.\n\nThe accommodation is well laid out and briefly comprises an entrance hallway, a bright and spacious living/dining area, a fitted kitchen, two well-proportioned bedrooms and a main bathroom. The apartment benefits from excellent natural light throughout, creating a comfortable and welcoming living environment.\n\nOne of the key attractions of this property is its excellent central location, with MacDonagh Junction Shopping Centre just a short stroll away, offering a wide selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, a cinema and a variety of everyday conveniences. The property is also within walking distance of Kilkenny Train Station and MacDonagh Bus Station, providing regular services to Dublin, Waterford and surrounding towns, making it ideal for those who rely on public transport.\n\nFor commuters travelling by car, the apartment also benefits from easy access to the M9 motorway, located approximately 10 minutes away, providing convenient routes to Dublin, Waterford, Carlow and beyond.\n\nKilkenny's vibrant city centre is quite literally on your doorstep, offering an array of restaurants, cafés, boutiques, cultural attractions and historic landmarks such as Kilkenny Castle and St. Canice's Cathedral, all easily accessible on foot.\n\nThis property presents an excellent opportunity to acquire a city centre apartment in one of Kilkenny's most convenient and sought-after locations, offering both lifestyle appeal and strong investment potential.\n\nViewing is highly recommended.\n\nACCOMODATION\n\nEntrance Hall - Step into a warm and inviting entrance hall featuring stylish laminated flooring that leads you into the heart of the home with three spacious storage closets.\n\nKitchen/Dining Area - Experience the joy of open-plan living in the expansive kitchen and dining area. Adorned with sleek laminated flooring, this space is perfect for entertaining guests or enjoying family meals. The kitchen is equipped with overhead and under-counter cabinets providing ample storage, alongside integrated appliances that enhance functionality and style.\n\nMain Bathroom - Featuring tiled flooring and a classic white WC. Enjoy the comfort of a towel warmer, a refreshing power shower, and a relaxing bathtub.\n\nBedroom 1 - Retreat to the spacious master bedroom, a true haven of relaxation. This large double room features plush carpet flooring and offers direct access to communal areas, making it both convenient and private. Enjoy the luxury of a built-in wardrobe, providing plenty of storage while maintaining the room's elegant aesthetic.\n\nEn Suite - Featuring tiled flooring and a refreshing power shower, this space combines style and comfort. The classic white WC and sleek towel warmer add a touch of luxury to your daily routine.\n\nBedroom 2 - Charming double room with cozy carpet flooring and its own built-in wardrobe, making it an ideal space for guests or family members.\n\n*Disclaimer - photos have been edited using AI to enhance or brighten the image*"
      },
      {
